{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33761","headline":"正乐府十篇 诮虚器 · 皮日休","name":"正乐府十篇 诮虚器","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"襄阳作髹器，中有库露真。\n持以遗北虏，绐云生有神。\n每岁走其使，所费如云屯。\n吾闻古圣王，修德来远人。\n未闻作巧诈，用欺禽兽君。\n吾道尚如此，戎心安足云。\n如何汉宣帝，却得呼韩臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33761.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33761","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}